@startuml
title Review Test History Sequence (/api/quiz/history)

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Learner
boundary "Review Test History UI" as HistoryUi
control "QuizSessionsController\n(BE API)" as BeController
entity "QuizHistoryRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as BeHistoryRequestDto
entity "QuizHistoryItemResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as BeHistoryResponseDto
control "IQuizHistoryService" as IQuizHistoryService
control "QuizHistoryService" as HistoryService
entity "TestSession" as TestSessionEntity
control "IQuizHistoryRepository" as IQuizHistoryRepository
control "QuizHistoryRepository" as HistoryRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over HistoryUi, MySQL
Checked in current code:
BE controller exists: QuizSessionsController.
BE request/response DTOs exist: QuizHistoryRequest and QuizHistoryItemResponse.
Endpoint is GET /api/quiz/history with page and limit query parameters.
Mobile currently has no QuizApiService.getHistory method and no FE history DTO.
Profile UI has a Test history entry, but no Mobile API flow is implemented for history yet.
Entity exists: TestSession.
Interfaces used in code: IQuizHistoryService, IQuizHistoryRepository.
end note

Learner -> HistoryUi: Open test history
HistoryUi -> BeController: GET /api/quiz/history\npage, limit
BeController -> BeHistoryRequestDto: Bind query string
BeHistoryRequestDto --> BeController: QuizHistoryRequest
BeController -> BeController: Check authenticated user

alt User id missing
    BeController --> HistoryUi: HTTP 401 error
else User authenticated
    BeController -> IQuizHistoryService: GetHistoryAsync(userId, query)
    IQuizHistoryService -> HistoryService: GetHistoryAsync(userId, query)
    HistoryService -> IQuizHistoryService: Validate page and limit
    IQuizHistoryService -> HistoryService: Validate page and limit

    alt Query validation fails
        HistoryService --> BeController: Validation failure
        BeController --> HistoryUi: HTTP 400 error
    else Query validation success
        HistoryService -> IQuizHistoryRepository: GetHistoryAsync(userId, page, limit)
        IQuizHistoryRepository -> HistoryRepository: GetHistoryAsync(userId, page, limit)
        HistoryRepository -> DbContext: Query paged test sessions
        DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT COUNT(*),\nSELECT test_sessions
        MySQL --> DbContext: History rows
        DbContext -> TestSessionEntity: Read TestSession rows
        TestSessionEntity --> DbContext: Quiz history rows
        DbContext --> HistoryRepository: Paged history result
        HistoryRepository --> HistoryService: Paged history
        HistoryService --> BeController: History result
        BeController -> BeHistoryResponseDto: Create QuizHistoryItemResponse list
        BeHistoryResponseDto --> BeController: QuizHistoryItemResponse list
        BeController --> HistoryUi: HTTP 200 OK\nQuizHistoryItemResponse list
    end
end

@enduml
